		{
			"type": "text",
			"version": 41,
			"x": 65,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 586.69580078125,
			"height": 225,
			"strokeColor": "#f0883e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "🏗️  __init__(self, model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B\", *, device=None, dtype=None, trust_remote_code=True)\n\nAuto-selects device (priority order):\n  1. torch.backends.mps.is_available() → \"mps\" (Apple Silicon)\n  2. torch.cuda.is_available() → \"cuda\" (NVIDIA GPU)\n  3. fallback → \"cpu\"\n\nAuto-selects dtype:\n  GPU/MPS → torch.float16 (half precision, lower memory)\n  CPU     → torch.float32 (full precision)\n\nLoads tokenizer via AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)\n  • Sets pad_token_id = eos_token_id if missing (common for causal LMs)\n\nLoads model via AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_name)\n  • Uses device_map=\"auto\" for CUDA (multi-GPU support)\n  • Moves model to device, sets eval mode\n  • Disables gradient computation (p.requires_grad = False) — inference only",
			"fontSize": 10,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"id": "r1fX2him",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"elementType": "text",
			"containerId": "box_init",
			"originalText": "🏗️  __init__(self, model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B\", *, device=None, dtype=None, trust_remote_code=True)\n\nAuto-selects device (priority order):\n  1. torch.backends.mps.is_available() → \"mps\" (Apple Silicon)\n  2. torch.cuda.is_available() → \"cuda\" (NVIDIA GPU)\n  3. fallback → \"cpu\"\n\nAuto-selects dtype:\n  GPU/MPS → torch.float16 (half precision, lower memory)\n  CPU     → torch.float32 (full precision)\n\nLoads tokenizer via AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)\n  • Sets pad_token_id = eos_token_id if missing (common for causal LMs)\n\nLoads model via AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_name)\n  • Uses device_map=\"auto\" for CUDA (multi-GPU support)\n  • Moves model to device, sets eval mode\n  • Disables gradient computation (p.requires_grad = False) — inference only",
