		{
			"type": "text",
			"version": 55,
			"x": 64.75306788053348,
			"y": 625,
			"width": 207.0769500732422,
			"height": 162.5,
			"strokeColor": "#d2a8ff",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "🔧 Utility methods for HF Hub file access\n\nget_path_to_vocab_file()\nget_path_to_merges_file()\nget_path_to_tokenizer_file()\n\nEach downloads the corresponding\nfile from HuggingFace Hub using\nhf_hub_download and returns its\nlocal cache path.\n\nThese are not used in the pipeline\nbut could be for debugging / inspection.",
			"fontSize": 10,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"id": "hub_text",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"elementType": "text",
			"containerId": "box_hub",
			"originalText": "🔧 Utility methods for HF Hub file access\n\nget_path_to_vocab_file()\nget_path_to_merges_file()\nget_path_to_tokenizer_file()\n\nEach downloads the corresponding\nfile from HuggingFace Hub using\nhf_hub_download and returns its\nlocal cache path.\n\nThese are not used in the pipeline\nbut could be for debugging / inspection.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"versionNonce": 986686357,
			"index": "a7",
			"isDeleted": false,
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"angle": 0,
			"seed": 14,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1781603785817,
			"link": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"locked": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"type": "text",
			"version": 53,
			"x": 351,
			"y": 620,
			"width": 534.2557373046875,
			"height": 330,
			"strokeColor": "#ffa657",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "🔍 Key design notes\n\n1. **Why a wrapper?** — The raw HF API is verbose and exposes many switches.\n   Small_LLM_Model encapsulates the common case: load a model, run inference.\n   The decoder module only needs 3 methods: encode, decode, get_logits_from_input_ids.\n\n2. **Auto device selection** — mps > cuda > cpu. This makes the code portable\n   across MacBooks (MPS), Linux desktops (CUDA), and CI runners (CPU).\n\n3. **Auto dtype** — float16 on GPU saves ~2x memory vs float32.\n   Critical for Qwen3-0.6B which is ~1.2GB in float32.\n\n4. **trust_remote_code=True** — Some HF models need custom code to load.\n   Qwen3 needs this. It's a safety tradeoff but required for the model.\n\n5. **eval() + requires_grad = False** — Inference-only mode.\n   No gradient tape = faster + less memory. If you tried to call .backward()\n   it would fail (which is good — you shouldn't train in this script).\n\n6. **Not a complete SDK** — The name \"llm_sdk\" is aspirational.\n   It's missing batching, streaming, quantization, etc. It's a focused\n   tool for this specific constrained-decoding project.",
			"fontSize": 12,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"id": "vZofu2wX",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"elementType": "text",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "🔍 Key design notes\n\n1. **Why a wrapper?** — The raw HF API is verbose and exposes many switches.\n   Small_LLM_Model encapsulates the common case: load a model, run inference.\n   The decoder module only needs 3 methods: encode, decode, get_logits_from_input_ids.\n\n2. **Auto device selection** — mps > cuda > cpu. This makes the code portable\n   across MacBooks (MPS), Linux desktops (CUDA), and CI runners (CPU).\n\n3. **Auto dtype** — float16 on GPU saves ~2x memory vs float32.\n   Critical for Qwen3-0.6B which is ~1.2GB in float32.\n\n4. **trust_remote_code=True** — Some HF models need custom code to load.\n   Qwen3 needs this. It's a safety tradeoff but required for the model.\n\n5. **eval() + requires_grad = False** — Inference-only mode.\n   No gradient tape = faster + less memory. If you tried to call .backward()\n   it would fail (which is good — you shouldn't train in this script).\n\n6. **Not a complete SDK** — The name \"llm_sdk\" is aspirational.\n   It's missing batching, streaming, quantization, etc. It's a focused\n   tool for this specific constrained-decoding project.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"versionNonce": 1444793403,
			"index": "a8",
